{"4175740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Monarch Cocoon", "steam_appid": 4175740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through the cycle of nature in<strong> </strong>stunning experience featuring five beautifully crafted environments connected by a central island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the Monarch Cocoon world lies a tranquil island with four glowing, egg-shaped buildings — each a gateway to a different season. Step through the portals and explore unique worlds, each alive with its own atmosphere, sounds, and beauty:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌸 <strong>Spring</strong> – Wander through blooming gardens under a warm sun. Birds sing, butterflies flutter, and cherry blossoms fill the air.<br>🌊 <strong>Summer</strong> – Dive beneath crystal waters where coral reefs shimmer, fish glide by, and massive bionic jellyfish float around the statue of a water god. Sunlight dances across the seafloor with beautiful caustics.<br>🔥 <strong>Autumn</strong> – Explore a volcanic realm of red forests and ancient statues of angels and demons, their fires lighting the foggy dusk. The world glows in deep crimson hues.<br>❄️ <strong>Winter</strong> – Step into a snowy wonderland filled with gifts, glowing Christmas trees, icy sculptures, and peaceful music beneath a bright winter sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, explore, or drive across each map using cars scattered throughout the environments. Every world invites you to experience a different mood, weather, and sense of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Monarch Cocoon<strong> </strong>is a meditative exploration of time, nature, and imagination — where each season tells its own story.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey through the cycle of nature in<strong> </strong>stunning experience featuring five beautifully crafted environments connected by a central island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the Monarch Cocoon world lies a tranquil island with four glowing, egg-shaped buildings — each a gateway to a different season. Step through the portals and explore unique worlds, each alive with its own atmosphere, sounds, and beauty:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌸 <strong>Spring</strong> – Wander through blooming gardens under a warm sun. Birds sing, butterflies flutter, and cherry blossoms fill the air.<br>🌊 <strong>Summer</strong> – Dive beneath crystal waters where coral reefs shimmer, fish glide by, and massive bionic jellyfish float around the statue of a water god. Sunlight dances across the seafloor with beautiful caustics.<br>🔥 <strong>Autumn</strong> – Explore a volcanic realm of red forests and ancient statues of angels and demons, their fires lighting the foggy dusk. The world glows in deep crimson hues.<br>❄️ <strong>Winter</strong> – Step into a snowy wonderland filled with gifts, glowing Christmas trees, icy sculptures, and peaceful music beneath a bright winter sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk, explore, or drive across each map using cars scattered throughout the environments. Every world invites you to experience a different mood, weather, and sense of wonder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Monarch Cocoon<strong> </strong>is a meditative exploration of time, nature, and imagination — where each season tells its own story.</p>", "short_description": "Embark on a journey through four breathtaking worlds, each reflecting a season of life — all connected through a mysterious island at the center of time.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175740/8db9dbaf6b86867f676d85710382282c95bb8eb0/header.jpg?t=1765547262", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4175740/e3586ace56af4fa710031f78cb09978e0415bb92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765547262", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai